<title>USA: South Street Financial sets initial div.</title>
<headline>South Street Financial sets initial div.</headline>
<dateline>ALBEMARLE, N.C. 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Street Financial Corp said Tuesday it has declared an initial quarterly cash dividend at $0.08 per share for the first quarter ended December 31.</p>
<p>The dividend is to be paid out February 7 to shareholders of record as of the close of business on January 24.</p>
<p>South Street is the holding company of Home Savings Bank of Albermarle Inc SSB.</p>
